we want to check a expression is balanced or not?
like compiler check the syntax!

(1+2) is balanced
((1+2)) is balanced
([1]+[2]) is balanced
{[(1+2)-[(1-2)]]} is balanced
{[(1+2)-[(1-2)]]}[ is not balanced!

Note: the algorithm is when we see close term like "]" or ")" or "}"
      we should move back, and see if the pre item
      is related open term or not!
      remove it then go forward!
      go back one step means "STACK"


Important note: I defined the stack obj out side of balanced method
                I create just one instance of BalancedExpression on Main
                so he use just one stack!
                so I need clear the stack at the top of the method.
                but in multithread app, we will have problem here!
                in that situation we should confinement approach
                we should isolate stack obj in each thread
                so we can create stack obj inside the method!